 (started 2024-06-06)","travel_h":0.36,"travel_speed_mph":5.8,"travel_distance_km":3.4,"start_to_spike_h":168.5,"arrival_local":"2024-06-06T06:51","spike_hour_local":["2024-06-13T07:00","2024-06-13T08:00"]}},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_1614","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[32.0,45.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On June 13, 2024, the Texas state monitor at HRM-16 Deer Park recorded 12.6 ppb of benzene in the 6:00 a.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.135 ppb. Wind there came from 45 degrees at 5.8 mph. 21 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. One of them, Intercontinental Terminals Deer Park Terminal, filed emissions-event report 424533 for 67 pounds of benzene from 06:30 to 12:00 local time that day. These readings are consistent with that release reaching the monitors. Requested follow-up: confirm whether nearby residents were notified, and whether the reported amount accounts for these readings.","draft_es":"El 13 de junio de 2024, el monitor estatal de Texas en HRM-16 Deer Park registró 12.6 ppb de benceno en la hora de las 6:00 a. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.135 ppb. El viento venía de 45 grados a 5.8 mph. Hay 21 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. Una de ellas, Intercontinental Terminals Deer Park Terminal, presentó el informe de evento de emisiones 424533 por 67 libras de benceno de 06:30 a 12:00, hora local, ese día. Estas lecturas son consistentes con que esa emisión llegó a los monitores. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si se avisó a los residentes cercanos y si la cantidad reportada explica estas lecturas.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0069_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0069","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87626,"sha256":"bd475d9466e69723b686d3e130895cc15488f62bbdbb4ee951e8e57bb034214a","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:33+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0307_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87819,"sha256":"96c47bbe3564875b6b174ff098f20622d5526f33cac8b1075008d94ba8fcbdbd","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:54+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0057_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0057","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88659,"sha256":"9fd0f24824bbd59b6665ecd64d00bc41e0bc4eb95664b798324d86e47830ab8c","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:17+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_1614_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_1614","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88657,"sha256":"d79be738d81925c1